  "distance_km": 11.5,
  "description": "This walk takes you from Glynde to Seaford in Sussex. The walk follows bridleways, footpaths and country lanes across the South Downs with fabulous views towards the coast as you go. You can start at the car park in Glynde and head south towards Beddingham Hill, a fine viewpoint on the trail. You continue south past Fore Hill, Poverty Bottom and Bishopstone with nice farmland views.The route finishes with a nice coastal section along the seafront in Seaford. You can continue your walking in the area on the popularGlynde to Lewes Walkor theSeaford to East Dean Walk.",
